      <activity id="da8bd320-f6d2-51f2-915c-ce2a18ea5577" activityNameId="37b0cf27-40de-5bd4-9251-ac1734626512" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Pc-Si wafer, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Pc-Si wafer, at plant
Production of wafers (100mm * 100mm) with a thickness of 300um and a sawing loss of 200um. ;
UUID: 0a4a365d-990a-3c89-b290-055f390fafa9
Sawing and cleaning of wafers.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Use of multi wire saws.
Time period: Use of data from an environmental report for a production plant (ca. 3 mio. wafers per year) and some data from older publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Environmental report and LCA studies. 
Extrapolations: Environmental report of wafer production for electronic uses and own assumption for changes in sawing technology.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a4a365d-990a-3c89-b290-055f390fafa9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
